{"content_hash": "d4cecfe4dbae7eb0", "version_id": 701, "article_id": 71, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Japan sends a spacecraft to bring back a piece of Mars' moon", "title_zh": "日本发射飞船，要去火星的月亮上取一块石头回来", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "bbc_science", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvgxvkv54w1o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1697689806591-e5e4269f10eb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8bWlzc2lvbiUyMHNldCUyMGJsYXN0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTIzNjYxMjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Behnam Mohsenzadeh on Unsplash", "author": "Behnam Mohsenzadeh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@bmohsenzadeh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bunch-of-smoke-is-billowing-out-of-a-building-Q5vwV1Xyor4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "b923fc532535"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-19", "word_count": 92, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "Japan will launch a spacecraft on Monday. It will fly to Phobos, a moon of Mars. Then it will bring a small piece back to Earth.", "lead_zh": "日本将在周一发射一艘飞船。它会飞往火星的一颗卫星——火卫一。然后它会把一小块石头带回地球。", "preview": "The spacecraft leaves from Japan. It will reach Phobos in August 2027. This is the first mission to bring back a piece of Mars or its moons.", "preview_zh": "飞船从日本出发。它将在2027年8月到达火卫一。这是第一次从火星或其卫星上带回样本的任务。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 692, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 30.8, "size_bytes": 185760, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 31.55, "size_bytes": 190224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/71/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 33.975, "size_bytes": 204768, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/71/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 30.15, "size_bytes": 181872, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/71/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 31.775, "size_bytes": 191664, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 107, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/71/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fec3522/content/data/versions/701.json", "paragraphs": ["The spacecraft leaves from Japan. It will reach Phobos in August 2027. This is the first mission to bring back a piece of Mars or its moons.", "Phobos is very small. It is only about 20km across. A small robot will land on it and pick up some dust.", "The dust comes back to Earth in 2031. It lands in Australia. The sample is just 10g, but it is very important.", "Scientists want to know how Phobos formed. The sample can answer this question. It may also hold small pieces of Mars."], "paragraphs_zh": ["飞船从日本出发。它将在2027年8月到达火卫一。这是第一次从火星或其卫星上带回样本的任务。", "火卫一非常小，直径只有约20公里。一个小机器人会降落在上面，收集一些尘土。", "这些尘土将在2031年回到地球，降落在澳大利亚。样本只有10克，但非常重要。", "科学家想知道火卫一是怎么形成的。这个样本能回答这个问题。它里面可能还有火星的小碎片。"], "body": "The spacecraft leaves from Japan. It will reach Phobos in August 2027. This is the first mission to bring back a piece of Mars or its moons.\n\nPhobos is very small. It is only about 20km across. A small robot will land on it and pick up some dust.\n\nThe dust comes back to Earth in 2031. It lands in Australia. The sample is just 10g, but it is very important.\n\nScientists want to know how Phobos formed. The sample can answer this question. It may also hold small pieces of Mars.", "body_zh": "飞船从日本出发。它将在2027年8月到达火卫一。这是第一次从火星或其卫星上带回样本的任务。\n\n火卫一非常小，直径只有约20公里。一个小机器人会降落在上面，收集一些尘土。\n\n这些尘土将在2031年回到地球，降落在澳大利亚。样本只有10克，但非常重要。\n\n科学家想知道火卫一是怎么形成的。这个样本能回答这个问题。它里面可能还有火星的小碎片。", "text": "The spacecraft leaves from Japan. It will reach Phobos in August 2027. This is the first mission to bring back a piece of Mars or its moons. Phobos is very small. It is only about 20km across. A small robot will land on it and pick up some dust. The dust comes back to Earth in 2031. It lands in Australia. The sample is just 10g, but it is very important. Scientists want to know how Phobos formed. The sample can answer this question. It may also hold small pieces of Mars.", "vocab": [{"word": "spacecraft", "pos": "noun", "zh": "飞船", "note": "指航天器", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发射", "note": "常用于火箭、飞船", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "moon", "pos": "noun", "zh": "卫星；月亮", "note": "这里指火星的卫星", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sample", "pos": "noun", "zh": "样本", "note": "取回的石头或尘土", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "dust", "pos": "noun", "zh": "尘土", "note": "不可数名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "land", "pos": "verb", "zh": "降落；着陆", "note": "反义词是 take off", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "scientist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "科学家", "note": "复数 scientists", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "form", "pos": "verb", "zh": "形成", "note": "how it formed 它怎么形成的", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-18